<title>SWEDEN: Sodra says NorScan stocks fell 103,000 tns in May.</title>
<headline>Sodra says NorScan stocks fell 103,000 tns in May.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sodra Cell, a unit of Swedish forestry cooperative Sodra, said on Thursday that North American and Scandinavian (NorScan) pulp stocks fell by 103,000 tonnes in May.</p>
</text>
